**.wlan[*].radio.transmitter.headerLength = 4b
**.wlan[*].bitrate = 2Mbps
**.wlan[*].mac.headerLength = 20B

%contains: stdout
DSDV adaptive dumps PASS: quiet, churn, byte budget, bounds, urgent loss, overflow, heterogeneous peers
